00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:12.185
- Oh, "Reservations for
Eight," I think it was called.

00:01:12.185 --> 00:01:13.390
- [Kelly And the guys
and the girls were, yeah.

00:01:13.390 --> 00:01:14.223
I loved that one.

00:01:14.223 --> 00:01:15.230
- And we all got in big fights,

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:16.384
the women against the men.

00:01:16.384 --> 00:01:17.217
- I know, 'cause I love it.

00:01:17.217 --> 00:01:18.292
- Yeah.

00:01:18.292 --> 00:01:19.125
- Yeah.

00:01:19.125 --> 00:01:19.958
