a great story to tell

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:36.040
or a great joke to tell and
you can't wait to tell it?

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:36.873
- Yeah.

00:04:36.873 --> 00:04:37.830
- That kind of energy?

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:40.768
So, I love the scenes where
I get to actually do standup.

00:04:40.768 --> 00:04:41.601
- [Kelly] Oh, yeah.

00:04:41.601 --> 00:04:43.900
- You know, 'cause I get to
do the fun part of standup

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:45.091
without the scary part.

00:04:45.091 --> 00:04:45.924
(audience clapping)

00:04:45.924 --> 00:04:46.757
- Yeah.

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:51.380
This relationship is so interesting

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:53.697
